[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrapy/scrapy/issues/8402","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrapy/scrapy","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrapy/scrapy/issues/8402/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrapy/scrapy/issues/8402/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrapy/scrapy/issues/8402/events","html_url":"https://github.com/scrapy/scrapy/pull/8402","id":6015106311,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAAgUXs8AAAABKdoW4Q","number":8402,"title":"Require Brotli 1.2.1 for the upstream decoder fix","user":{"login":"Devdha","id":46529663,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTI5NjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46529663?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devdha","html_url":"https://github.com/Devdha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devdha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devdha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devdha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devdha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devdha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devdha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devdha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devdha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devdha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":4604014165,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAAgUXs8AAAABEmuuVQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrapy/scrapy/labels/spam","name":"spam","color":"6A4C81","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-24T16:31:01Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T16:31:13Z","closed_at":"2026-10-24T16:31:13Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrapy/scrapy/pulls/8402","html_url":"https://github.com/scrapy/scrapy/pull/8402","diff_url":"https://github.com/scrapy/scrapy/pull/8402.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/scrapy/scrapy/pull/8402.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Background\n\nCVE-2026-111497 is an out-of-bounds write in the Google Brotli decoder, fixed in Brotli 1.2.1. Scrapy decompresses `Content-Encoding: br` responses in `scrapy/utils/_compression.py` (`_unbrotli()` calls `brotli.Decompressor()`), so responses from arbitrary sites reach the decoder.\n\nThe current lower bound, `brotli>=1.2.0`, still permits the vulnerable 1.2.0 release. This raises the floor to the first fixed release in the 1.2 line.\n\nUpstream release: https://github.com/google/brotli/releases/tag/v1.2.1\n\n## Change\n\n- `brotli>=1.2.0` → `brotli>=1.2.1` in `pyproject.toml`.\n\nNo code changes.\n\n## Testing\n\nThe existing compression middleware tests cover this path:\n\n- `tests/test_downloadermiddleware_httpcompression.py::test_process_response_br`\n- `test_compression_bomb_setting_br`\n- `test_compression_bomb_spider_attr_br`\n- `test_compression_bomb_request_meta_br`\n\nThese run in CI against the new dependency floor.","closed_by":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https: